{
  "bookId": "hero-212207",
  "id": "bond-35311",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35311001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "你来得正好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是有什么需要我帮忙的吗？这是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "是棺材。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊哈哈……有点吓到。为什么突然制作这样的东西？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "上次的问题，你有答案了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35311007",
              "text": "你是说生命和艺术的关系吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "35311007",
              "text": "实话说有些难住我了，也许生命短暂，但艺术恒久。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35311006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "正因为人类生命转瞬即逝，才想留下永垂不朽的作品。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "不错的回答，我会把这句话刻在我们的棺盖上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35311010",
              "text": "我们的……棺盖?"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35311009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "我无法阻止死亡将你夺走。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "但在那一天来临时，我会陪着你一起面对永恒的寂静。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35311012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "只有我和你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
